# Evidence is bytes. Signed and hashed files must reach every computer exactly as they were
# signed: never let git convert line endings (Windows checkouts would otherwise turn LF into
# CRLF and every signature and hash would fail).
* text=auto eol=lf
crates/cursiv-evidence/tests/fixtures/** -text
examples/sample-package/** -text
*.json -text
*.jsonl -text
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
